contentText:
Six years after DMX ’s death, his estate is quietly battling with a longtime friend and collaborator — over both unreleased recordings and his claim to be a co-writer of DMX’s breakout hit.&nbsp;

DJ Superior (Michael Murray), DMX’s friend from his early days in Yonkers, says he owns many items tied to the star, including VHS videos, handwritten lyric sheets and cassette tapes of never-released tracks. He tried to auction some of them last year, and now he wants to release music he says he co-owns.

